      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Well yeah, for desktop vrchat you need to have the collider outside of a wall for vrc_interact elements. Has been like that for a while, if not forever. Definitely a bug though, i discovered it with stations when they were inside a wall.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
